H_010 - Having observed statues, drawings, or images featuring humans mixed with animals (such as in Egyptian mythology), this philosophical framework remains the same: humans must conform to a certain standard as much as possible (two legs, two arms, one head, possibly five fingers per limb, physical size of both the body and limbs within certain parameters, etc.), since all existing technology is built on these parameters. In the case of a disability, remedies can still be found.